        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36607?u=79d8c114db476a7ecc6328b328f71d9d758368c7&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Epic</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">These are the planned breaking changes for npm 12:</p>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> engines.node update (TBD)</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> npm serve?</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> bun lock default ingore</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> init.author prompt</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> default license</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2839152385\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/npm/cli/issues/8090\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/npm/cli/pull/8090/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/npm/cli/pull/8090\">npm/cli#8090</a></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> remove url.parse from nopt</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> server.js autodiscovery in run-script <code class=\"notranslate\">npm run start</code></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3557459424\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/npm/pacote/issues/434\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/npm/pacote/pull/434/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/npm/pacote/pull/434\">npm/pacote#434</a></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> globstar hacks</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3880352611\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/npm/pacote/issues/442\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/npm/pacote/pull/442/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/npm/pacote/pull/442\">npm/pacote#442</a> git subdir breaking?</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> npm-shrinkwrap</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> error on unknown flags?</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> New \"npm cli future changes\" issue</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">We will get issues made for each of these next.</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/npm/statusboard/issues/1068",
            "title": "npm 12",
            "date_modified": "2026-02-24T21:07:08.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-02-24T20:26:12.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "wraithgar",
                "url": "https://github.com/wraithgar"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36607?u=79d8c114db476a7ecc6328b328f71d9d758368c7&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Epic</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">There are currently only a handful of production dependencies in npm that are outdated.  This is our plan for getting them updated if possible.</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">env-paths</code></p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>required by <code class=\"notranslate\">node-gyp</code> and will be updated in the next semver major of node-gyp (needs an engines update and is waiting on node 20 EOL I believe.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">iconv-lite</code></p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>required through <code class=\"notranslate\">encoding</code> by <code class=\"notranslate\">minipass-fetch</code>.</li>\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3964342134\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/npm/minipass-fetch/issues/181\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/npm/minipass-fetch/pull/181/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/npm/minipass-fetch/pull/181\">npm/minipass-fetch#181</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">err-code</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">retry</code></p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>required by <code class=\"notranslate\">promise-retry</code>, which is used by:\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">pacote</code> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3970460329\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/npm/pacote/issues/449\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/npm/pacote/pull/449/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/npm/pacote/pull/449\">npm/pacote#449</a></li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">make-fetch-happen</code> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3970444930\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/npm/make-fetch-happen/issues/340\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/npm/make-fetch-happen/pull/340/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/npm/make-fetch-happen/pull/340\">npm/make-fetch-happen#340</a></li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">@sigstore/sign</code> (blocked by <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3970347588\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/wraithgar/node-promise-retry/issues/4\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/wraithgar/node-promise-retry/pull/4/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/wraithgar/node-promise-retry/pull/4\">wraithgar/node-promise-retry#4</a>)</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">libnpmexec</code> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3970511409\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/npm/cli/issues/9008\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/npm/cli/pull/9008/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/npm/cli/pull/9008\">npm/cli#9008</a></li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">@npmcli/git</code> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3970480770\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/npm/git/issues/234\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/npm/git/pull/234/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/npm/git/pull/234\">npm/git#234</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>This package appears abandoned and the maintainer has no recent activity in github.</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://npm.im/@gar/promise-retry\" rel=\"nofollow\">A fork</a> was made and we are moving to it.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">minipass</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">yallist</code></p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>required by <code class=\"notranslate\">minipass-flush</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">minipass-pipeline</code>.</li>\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3964821086\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/isaacs/minipass-flush/issues/15\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/isaacs/minipass-flush/pull/15/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/isaacs/minipass-flush/pull/15\">isaacs/minipass-flush#15</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3970173759\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/isaacs/minipass-pipeline/issues/17\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/isaacs/minipass-pipeline/pull/17/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/isaacs/minipass-pipeline/pull/17\">isaacs/minipass-pipeline#17</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
            "url": "https://github.com/npm/statusboard/issues/1065",
            "title": "Outdated cli deps",
            "date_modified": "2026-02-20T22:26:45.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-02-20T20:15:57.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "wraithgar",
