        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36607?u=79d8c114db476a7ecc6328b328f71d9d758368c7&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Epic</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">pacote supports <code class=\"notranslate\">allow-git</code> <code class=\"notranslate\">allow-remote</code>, etc to limit fetching from non-registry endpoints.  npm needs an aggregate flag so folks can configure them in one place.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This will be <code class=\"notranslate\">--allow-type</code> with the values being a loose mapping to npm-package-arg types (registry will be an analog for version/range/tag).</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/npm/statusboard/issues/1064",
            "title": "add allow-type to npm as an aggregate for allow-git, etc",
            "date_modified": "2026-02-18T16:35:03.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-02-18T16:34:09.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "wraithgar",
                "url": "https://github.com/wraithgar"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36607?u=79d8c114db476a7ecc6328b328f71d9d758368c7&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Epic</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">With the release of <a href=\"https://github.blog/open-source/git/highlights-from-git-2-51/\" rel=\"nofollow\">git 2.51</a> support for sha-256 hashes in git references has become something to plan for.  Currently npm assumes a 40 sha-1 hash length for git, and that will need to update if we want to support sha-256.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">A (growing) list of places that likely need change (or at least tests)</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/npm/hosted-git-info\">https://github.com/npm/hosted-git-info</a>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3908510652\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/npm/hosted-git-info/issues/324\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/npm/hosted-git-info/pull/324/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/npm/hosted-git-info/pull/324\">npm/hosted-git-info#324</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/npm/npm-package-arg\">https://github.com/npm/npm-package-arg</a>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3908157906\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/npm/npm-package-arg/issues/220\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/npm/npm-package-arg/pull/220/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/npm/npm-package-arg/pull/220\">npm/npm-package-arg#220</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/npm/git\">https://github.com/npm/git</a>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3917590264\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/npm/git/issues/233\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/npm/git/pull/233/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/npm/git/pull/233\">npm/git#233</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/npm/pacote\">https://github.com/npm/pacote</a>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3917431175\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/npm/pacote/issues/445\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/npm/pacote/pull/445/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/npm/pacote/pull/445\">npm/pacote#445</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/npm/cli\">https://github.com/npm/cli</a>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3918197134\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/npm/cli/issues/8968\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/npm/cli/pull/8968/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/npm/cli/pull/8968\">npm/cli#8968</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
