        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1160199?u=8c4a0554dfeac6fe2cb8000f766f07921741a999&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Is there an existing issue for this?</h3>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> I have searched the existing issues</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Current Behavior</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://status.npmjs.org\" rel=\"nofollow\">status.npmjs.org</a> shows no downtime, but I'm getting errors like this:</p>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"WARN  post https://registry.npmjs.org/-/npm/v1/security/audits error (ERR_SOCKET_TIMEOUT). Will retry in 10 seconds. 2 retries left.\n WARN  post https://registry.npmjs.org/-/npm/v1/security/audits error (ERR_SOCKET_TIMEOUT). Will retry in 1 minute. 1 retries left.\n ERR_SOCKET_TIMEOUT  request to https://registry.npmjs.org/-/npm/v1/security/audits failed, reason: Socket timeout\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">WARN  post https://registry.npmjs.org/-/npm/v1/security/audits error (ERR_SOCKET_TIMEOUT). Will retry in 10 seconds. 2 retries left.\n WARN  post https://registry.npmjs.org/-/npm/v1/security/audits error (ERR_SOCKET_TIMEOUT). Will retry in 1 minute. 1 retries left.\n ERR_SOCKET_TIMEOUT  request to https://registry.npmjs.org/-/npm/v1/security/audits failed, reason: Socket timeout\n</code></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">also package updates were failing from registry (http status 502).</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://downdetector.com/status/npm/\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://downdetector.com/status/npm/</a><br>\nthis page clearly shows the issue affects more users than just me.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">according to hacker news multiple large service providers are down at the moment due some AWS us-east-1 outage.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Expected Behavior</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">npmjs status page should be improved to reflect actual system status (maybe multi region checks)</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Steps To Reproduce</h3>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>In this environment...</li>\n<li>With this config...</li>\n<li>Run '...'</li>\n<li>See error...</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Environment</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>npm:</li>\n<li>Node:</li>\n<li>OS:</li>\n<li>platform:</li>\n</ul>",
